## Facts
::assert{seen(mira, map)}
@narrator{when="holds('seen', ['mira', 'map'])"}: holds
@narrator{when="count('seen', ['_', '_']) == 2"}: count
@narrator{when="countDistinct('seen', ['_', '_'], 0) == 2"}: distinct
@narrator{when="validAt('seen', ['mira', 'map'], now())"}: valid
